The  driver  handles most ADB keyboards within the framework.  It
also provides an interface to translate key strokes to mouse but‐
ton events.  Which keys are translated to mouse button events can
be configured for each individual  keyboard  via  Controls  which
scan  code  is  used  for middle mouse button events.  Default is
103, which corresponds to F11.  Controls which scan code is  used
for right mouse button events.  Default is 111, which corresponds
to F12.
